      "writtenOn": "2024-05-29T04:07:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that some of the NetworkCallback methods call each other. IIRC there are onAvailable methods that take different numbers of arguments, and there are two variants of onBlockedStatusChanged. It looks like this treats them them all individually.",
