      "writtenOn": "2024-05-29T10:22:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes but the overloads use the same ID (CALLBACK_AVAILABLE, CALLBACK_BLK_CHANGED), so overriding any of them causes all of them to be called, and there shouldn\u0027t be missing callbacks.\n\nThe \"method calls another\" thing is made more explicit with the new annotations-based implementation",
